b07_jointly: ?"What would a joint return be for Piotr and Ola? PIT-6 .1 allows it only to spouses, and they aren't married (B-D04); Piotr's business is taxed under PIT-10 form (c) too (B-D02)" (jointly[2024])
  law date 2025-04-30, cut 2025-04-30
